    "body": "## Summary\n\n`MuseSparkRenderer` reimplements the checkpoint's `chat_template.jinja` token by token. The published template on [meta-models/Muse-Spark-Open-816B-A42B](https://huggingface.co/meta-models/Muse-Spark-Open-816B-A42B) changed on 2026-10-15 (revision `0fb02478`), and the renderer no longer produced the same prompts. This PR aligns it with that revision:\n\n- **Reasoning strength:** `low` is 8 and `medium` is 32 (were 16 and 64). `high` (256) and `xhigh` (512) are unchanged. `minimal` is gone from the template, so `MuseSparkRendererConfig(reasoning_effort=\"minimal\")` now raises, as the template does.\n- **Function schemas:** a schema without `additionalProperties` gets `\"additionalProperties\": false` appended, and missing or empty `parameters` render as `{\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {}, \"additionalProperties\": false}`. Schemas that already set `additionalProperties` are kept as is. The template describes these lines as \"as the training renderer prints it\".\n\nThe template also adds namespace tools and deferred tool loading (`defer_loading`, `deferred_render_mode`). The renderer does not implement those yet.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Compared against the published template with transformers' `apply_chat_template` and the checkpoint's tokenizer, over 5 conversations (user only, system + reasoning, tools with one and two tool calls and results, special-character escaping) at `low`, `medium` and `high`:\n  - before: 12 of 15 differed (reasoning strength and tool schemas);\n  - after: 0 differences, in text and in token ids.\n  - Against the previous template revision, the old renderer had 0 differences, so these two changes are the whole gap.\n- New unit tests in `tests/unit_tests/cpu/models/muse_spark/test_renderer.py` (the gated template is not vendored, so they assert the behavior directly):\n  - reasoning strength for each effort, and `minimal` rejected;\n  - `additionalProperties` appended when missing, kept when present, and the empty-parameters schema.\n- 5 tests fail without the renderer change and pass with it; the file passes (16 passed, 3 existing xfails).\n",
